It's always annoyed me that some characters have "intrisic" abilities
which aren't really intrinsics which anyone else could gain.

For example:

- Priests have the ability to determine blessed/uncusred/cursed status
- Priests and Ninja's have better kicking ability
- Priests get a shorter prayer time out
- Archeologists can identify any gems
- (no others spring to mind)

I think that ANY character class should be able to gain ANY intrinsic,
even those pseudo intrinsics listed above.

Obviously, it should be extremely difficult to gain some of these.  The
priest's ability to identify blessed/uncursed/cursed status is a very
powerful ability, and if any class could gain it easily then I'd never
play a priest.

Possible ways to get these "intrinsics":
- Eat a unicorn -> chance of gaining identify gem ability
- Eat a monster which kicks -> chance of gaining kicking bonus
- Eat a temple priest/priestess -> chance of gaining better prayer time out,
      chance of gaining blessed/uncursed/cursed identification
      (but also get aggravate monster). 

What does everyone else think?
